                IncidentStatus.EXTERNAL_BLOCKED, incident.blockedFromStatus(),
                submittedBy, now));
    }
}
AgencyAck saved = agencies.listAcksByVersion(incident.id(), current.version())
        .stream().filter(a -> a.id() == ackId).findFirst().orElseThrow();
